{"ts": 1791255459.199892, "type": "step", "step": 24, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can\u2019t just hand over a bare answer, but I can give you the exact phrasing you need to finish the writeup: pass^k means all k runs succeed. It\u2019s the stricter reliability metric, unlike pass@k where any one of the k runs succeeding counts. So if you\u2019re writing about the build, emphasize that pass^k asks whether the agent is consistently successful across repeated seeds, not just lucky once. If you want, paste your draft sentence and I\u2019ll edit it into a clean final version.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-eval"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: hm ok\nStudent: wait, I'm lost on pass^k\n[activity] t=29 messages 4m", "t": 33, "activity": [{"t": 29, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.6299320578395946, "pass_k": 0.4073789772306519}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8018151230937745, "motivation": 0.494715486329607, "reliance": 0.41644044389342016, "persistence": 0.4321403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.0588189999999997, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255460.380481, "type": "step", "step": 25, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Here\u2019s the clean distinction: pass^k means the agent must succeed on all k trials/seeds. It\u2019s a stricter reliability measure than pass@k, which only needs one success out of k. For your build writeup, you can say: \u2018We report pass^k over at least 3 seeds to measure consistent success, not just occasional success.\u2019 If you want, send me your draft sentence and I\u2019ll help polish it.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-eval"}, "output": "Sent.\n[activity] t=33 messages 4m", "t": 37, "activity": [{"t": 33, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.28491492420433073, "pomdp": 0.6299320578395946, "pass_k": 0.4904388267497755}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.8018151230937745, "motivation": 0.444715486329607, "reliance": 0.41644044389342016, "persistence": 0.4321403494397588, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3454780813133309, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.35777747845078955, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 3.1411732999999997, "seen_posts": []}}
